Weaponbench.name = Ember Weaponbench
Weaponbench.description = A four-tier weapon assembly bench.\nCraft at Tinkertable MK2: 30 wood, 20 stone, 8 copper plates and 4 iron rods from the caster.\nUpgrade with wood, stone and increasingly advanced cast components.\nMK1: copper; MK2: iron; MK3: thorium and cobalt; MK4: adamantite.\nHigher tiers add tools and reduce crafting time by up to 30%.
